        {
          "insert": "PUT /api/scenes/<id>?project=<project-id>",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ". Scene name is a normal editable scene field in Scene Settings. The post-save state is clean until the next mutation. In the desktop shell, native menu commands route save into the same editor command path used by browser keyboard handling."
