      "id": "b-40-authoring-surfaces-real-time-collaboration-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Real-time collaboration would require operational transform, conflict resolution, and presence. That is a substantial increase in surface area for no current benefit. The author and the agent rarely edit at the same instant, and the file-as-source-of-truth model is enough."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
